# Livract — Components, Classes, and Database Design

## Overview

This document defines the internal structure of the Livract MVP.

Livract is a mobile application that allows users in a local community to share, lend, give, or exchange books.

The MVP is built around four main domains:

- Users
- Books
- Exchange requests
- Messages

---

