## Message Class

The `Message` class represents a message sent inside a request conversation.

Messages are linked to a specific exchange request.

### Attributes

| Attribute | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Unique message identifier |
| requestId | UUID | ID of the related request |
| senderId | UUID | ID of the user sending the message |
| content | String | Message content |
| createdAt | Date | Date when the message was sent |

### Methods

| Method | Description |
|---|---|
| sendMessage() | Stores a new message |
| getMessagesByRequest() | Retrieves all messages linked to one request |

### Example

```javascript
class Message {
  constructor(id, requestId, senderId, content) {
    this.id = id;
    this.requestId = requestId;
    this.senderId = senderId;
    this.content = content;
    this.createdAt = new Date();
  }
}
```

