Stores application users.

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary Key | Unique user ID |
| firebase_uid | VARCHAR(255) | Unique, Not Null | Firebase user ID |
| username | VARCHAR(100) | Not Null | Public username |
| email | VARCHAR(255) | Unique, Not Null | User email |
| city | VARCHAR(100) | Not Null | User city or community |
| bio | TEXT | Nullable | Profile description |
| avatar_url | TEXT | Nullable | Profile image URL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Creation date |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Last update date |

---

## books Table

Stores book listings.

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary Key | Unique book ID |
| owner_id | UUID | Foreign Key | References users.id |
| title | VARCHAR(255) | Not Null | Book title |
| author | VARCHAR(255) | Not Null | Book author |
| description | TEXT | Nullable | Book description |
| condition | VARCHAR(50) | Not Null | Book condition |
| exchange_type | VARCHAR(50) | Not Null | lend, give, or exchange |
| status | VARCHAR(50) | Not Null | available, reserved, or unavailable |
| image_url | TEXT | Nullable | Book image URL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Creation date |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Last update date |

---

## exchange_requests Table

Stores requests made for books.

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary Key | Unique request ID |
| book_id | UUID | Foreign Key | References books.id |
| requester_id | UUID | Foreign Key | References users.id |
| owner_id | UUID | Foreign Key | References users.id |
| request_type | VARCHAR(50) | Not Null | borrow, give, or exchange |
| status | VARCHAR(50) | Not Null | pending, accepted, rejected, cancelled, completed |
| message | TEXT | Nullable | First message sent with the request |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Creation date |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Last update date |

---

## messages Table

Stores messages linked to exchange requests.

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Primary Key | Unique message ID |
| request_id | UUID | Foreign Key | References exchange_requests.id |
| sender_id | UUID | Foreign Key | References users.id |
| content | TEXT | Not Null | Message content |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | Not Null | Message creation date |

