# 8. Relationships

## User to Books

One user can own many books.

```text
users.id → books.owner_id
```

Relationship:

```text
One User → Many Books
```

---

## User to Exchange Requests

One user can send many requests.

```text
users.id → exchange_requests.requester_id
```

One user can also receive many requests as a book owner.

```text
users.id → exchange_requests.owner_id
```

Relationship:

```text
One User → Many Sent Requests
One User → Many Received Requests
```

---

## Book to Exchange Requests

One book can receive many requests.

```text
books.id → exchange_requests.book_id
```

Relationship:

```text
One Book → Many Requests
```

---

## Exchange Request to Messages

One exchange request can contain many messages.

```text
exchange_requests.id → messages.request_id
```

Relationship:

```text
One Request → Many Messages
```

